problem:
The canonical pre-start list that day-2 step 2 tells the team to compile is incomplete. Several items that other handoff docs say must go to the founder before start are missing from it:
- repo access for the team and how the untracked package reaches them (01 §0.1 t.5 and §3.2 say it „pripada listi … uz (c) i (d)”, but it is not there);
- who approves and who merges into `integration/waggle-next` (02 §7);
- the precedence order between AGENTS.md, the checklist, the plan and the handoff (02 §0: „founder ga potvrđuje pre starta”);
- ESK-01..ESK-03: tech lead, escalation channel, role assignment (05 §5.0);
- whether the Harness owner co-approves `chat.ts`/`chat-*.ts` merges (02 §3, 04 §2 and N-6), needed before W0-PR8/PR9/PR11.
02 §7 and 05 §5.0 still cite the list as „(a)–(f)”, but it now runs (a)–(i). A newcomer following 00 would send an incomplete approval request.
